    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      420.24,
      310.0,
      478.31
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Governmentintends to acquire the under-mentioned lands which arerequired for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      78.96,
      491.04,
      250.65,
      501.11
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Lands to be Acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      513.84,
      310.05,
      535.91
    ],
    "text": "Public purpose means to acquire lands for the Ihala ElaheraCanal Development Project.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      551.04,
      310.12,
      633.11
    ],
    "text": "The allotments of land, described below containing in Extent0.3894 Hectares from and out of as shown Lots 119-121 in theCadastral Plan No. 120251 (Zone No. 07, Sheet No. 03) dated27.09.2018 prepared by the Surveyor General located in theVillage of Samagipura in the No. 03 Elahera Grama Niladahri'sDivision in the Elahera Divisional Secretary's Division in theDistrict of Polonnaruwa in the North Central Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      644.64,
      310.04,
      702.71
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 119Name of Land: Nil, Land Use -Garden, a mixed cropscultivation aged nearly 20-30 Years; Claimant: Government,Enjoyer An additional crops cultivated by Muruththa WatteGedara Hendrick; Extent: 0.0046 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
