    ],
    "text": "North: Lot Nos. 118, 117, 119 and 120; East: Lot Nos. 120,123 and 122, Lot Nos. 1122 and 4; South: Lot No. 121 and 4;West: Lot Nos. 4, 118, 117 and 119.",
